# The Airbus A380-841, four Trent 970-84s: a flight model written for glideslope
# from Airbus's and the certifying authorities' documents, and held to them
# (assets/figures/a380.xml), by tools/make_a380.py.
#
#   name TEXT...                 what it is called
#   model NAME                   its JSBSim model, in data/jsbsim/aircraft
#   start AIRSPEED_KT THROTTLE   a flight begun in the air: its calibrated
#                                airspeed, and the throttle that holds it
#
# Its published figures, if it has them, are data/figures/MODEL.xml, and its
# selftest's log data/selftest/MODEL.log (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).

name Airbus A380-841
model a380
class airliner
start 250 0.57
# The speedbrake lever works its speedbrakes or spoilers (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).
speedbrakes
# Her main tyres and brakes, for a wet runway's grip (docs/ASSETS.md):
# Airbus A380 Aircraft Characteristics (Dec 2025), 7-2-0: 1400x530R23 mains at
# 15 bar, 218 psi, at 562,000 kg; the braking control system's anti-skid,
# digital and fully modulating.
brakes 218 fully-modulating
# Her cascade thrust reversers, on her inboard Trent 970s only
# (tools/make_a380.py), and the reverse brought to idle at 70 kt, as
# Airbus's procedure has it (the A320's file says where; docs/ASSETS.md).
reversers 70
# Her gear-extended speed, VLE, knots (src/sim/catalogue.hpp): her FCOM's limitations as crews' study sets give them: 250 kt/M.55,
# extended and operating alike.
gear-extended 250
# Her flap limit speeds, VFE, knots calibrated, by flap (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).
# Her type certificate data sheet, EASA.A.110 issue 17, gives none: "Refer
# to approved Airplane Flight Manual". From Airbus's A380-800 Flight Deck
# and Systems Briefing for Pilots (STL 945.1380/05 issue 3, May 2009,
# docs/ASSETS.md), its slats and flaps table, read through a third party's
# copy whose table text is scrambled and matched by position,
# https://pdfcoffee.com/a380-800-flight-deck-systems-briefing-for-pilots-3-pdf-free.html:
# configuration 1+F, flaps 8, 222; 2, 17, 220; 3, 26, 196; Full, 32, 182.
# Configuration 1's 263 is slats alone. A briefing, not a limitations
# document. A simulator community's list gives Full 186,
# https://community.infiniteflight.com/t/flap-limits-for-infinite-flight-20-1-edition/453409;
# the briefing's lower figure is kept.
flap-limit 8 222
flap-limit 17 220
flap-limit 26 196
flap-limit 32 182
